# Docker 构建上下文采用源码允许列表，避免本地 data/memory/logs/测试产物进入 builder。
**
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!agent_py_agent/
!agent_py_agent/**
!deploy/
!deploy/Dockerfile

